      <h1>China Lead-Acid Battery Manufacturers</h1>
      <p class="muted">Battery Manufacturer Directory · Last reviewed 2026-09-15</p>

      <div class="box">
        <strong>Direct answer:</strong> China is the world's <strong>largest lead-acid battery producer and
        exporter</strong>, and the leading manufacturers are concentrated in the automotive SLI and e-bike segments. The
        major names — <strong>Camel</strong> (骆驼), <strong>Fengfan</strong> (风帆), <strong>Tianneng</strong> (天能) and
        <strong>Chaowei</strong> (超威) — are large, listed or near-listed companies. Below them sits a long tail of
        smaller, regionally strong producers that compete on price and OEM/private-label supply.
      </div>

